# Every text file is stored and checked out with LF, on every platform.
# Biome formats with LF; without this, Windows checkouts (core.autocrlf=true,
# the default on GitHub's Windows runners) get CRLF and `npm run lint` fails.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary formats scaffolded templates may contain; never touch their bytes.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.webp binary
*.avif binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.eot binary
*.otf binary
*.zip binary
*.gz binary
*.tgz binary
